{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-page-template-js","path":"/biography/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"47ae564f-b2b8-5f11-909d-afd52b79abf5","html":"<p><strong>CV [<a href=\"/kato_cv_en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CV</a>]</strong></p>\n<p>I was born in Shiga, Japan.<br>\nAn <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Arsenal</a> fan. </p>\n<h3 id=\"education\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#education\" aria-label=\"education permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Education</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>April 2021 - present</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PhD student in Informatics. at Department of Social Informatics Graduate School of Informatics Kyoto University, <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/doku.php/en:start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yoshikawa, Ma Lab</a></li>\n<li>Focus on Privacy and Security of data engineering. (supervised by Dr. <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~cao/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yang Cao</a> and Prof. <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~yoshikawa/index-en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Masatoshi Yoshikawa</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>April 2019 - March 2021</p>\n<ul>\n<li>M.S. degree in Informatics. at Department of Social Informatics Graduate School of Informatics Kyoto University, <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/doku.php/en:start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yoshikawa, Ma Lab</a></li>\n<li>Master Thesis: PCT-TEE: Trajectory-based Private Contact Tracing System with Trusted Execution Environment. (supervised by Dr. <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~cao/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yang Cao</a> and Prof. <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~yoshikawa/index-en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Masatoshi Yoshikawa</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>April 2015 - March 2019</p>\n<ul>\n<li>B.S. degree in Engineering. Computer science course of Informatics and Mathematical Science, Faculty of Engineering, Kyoto University, <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/doku.php/en:start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yoshikawa, Ma Lab</a></li>\n<li>Bachelor Thesis: Future Prediction based on Web News Articles with Publication Source and Time. (supervised by Prof. <a href=\"https://www.mpkato.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Makoto P. Kato</a> and Prof. <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~yoshikawa/index-en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Masatoshi Yoshikawa</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>March 2015, Graduated from <a href=\"http://www.zeze-h.shiga-ec.ed.jp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Zeze high school</a>, Shiga.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ua-hrefresearchpublications-publications-au\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#ua-hrefresearchpublications-publications-au\" aria-label=\"ua hrefresearchpublications publications au permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><u><a href=\"/research#publications\"> Publications </a></u></h3>\n<h3 id=\"skills\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#skills\" aria-label=\"skills permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Skills</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Programming</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Advanced: Python</li>\n<li>Basic: C++, Rust, Java, Javascript, Web application infrastructures, Machine Learning frameworks (Pytorch)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Languages</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Japanese (Native)</li>\n<li>English (Basic)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"work-experience\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#work-experience\" aria-label=\"work experience permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Work Experience</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Researcher (intern) at <em>LINE Corporation</em>. (August 2020 - March 2021)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Research privacy enhanced technologies. [<a href=\"https://engineering.linecorp.com/ja/blog/differentially-private-data-exploration-for-multidimensional-data/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">blog post</a>]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Web application engineer (part-time) at <em>Hatena Inc</em>. (May 2019 - August 2020)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developing backend and frontend of large scale web applications mainly using Perl and JS.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Software engineer (intern) at <em>Recruit Co.,Ltd</em>. (October 2019 - November 2019)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developing backend and frontend large scale web applications mainly using Spring Boot and Java.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Data scientist (intern) at <em>Wantedly Inc</em>. (September 2019)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Working on proof of concept of a recommendation of a web application using Python and Ruby and BigQuery.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ML engineer (intern) at <em>M3 Inc</em>. (August 2019)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developing backend infrastructure of recommendation service of web applications mainly using Scala and Kubernetes.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Software engineer (part-time) at <em>MediaMaxJapan Inc</em>. (July 2018 - March 2019)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developing web applications mainly using Kotlin and TS. In particular, I was able to experience development that strictly followed DDD.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Software engineer (part-time) at <em>Kiizan Kiizan Inc</em>. (Feburary 2018 - May 2018)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developing web applications mainly using Ruby.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- ### Academic activities\n- [日本データベース学会学生企画](https://db-event.jpn.org/dbsj_students/)\n- [SIGMOD-J 講演 CIKM2020国際会議報告](http://www.sigmodj.org/conf/detail.php?conf_no=75) -->\n<h3 id=\"awards\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#awards\" aria-label=\"awards permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Awards</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Excellent Research Award at Kyoto University’s 16th ICT Innovation (Feb 2022) [<a href=\"/ICT-innovation-kato-2-18-2022.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">poster</a>]</li>\n<li>DEIM 2021 Student presentation award (Mar 2021)</li>\n<li>Master thesis award of social informatics department of Kyoto University (Feb 2021)</li>\n<li>DEIM 2020 Online presentation award (Mar 2020)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"academic-services\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#academic-services\" aria-label=\"academic services permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Academic Services</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>External reviewer: ICDE 2021, TKDE 2021</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"fundings\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#fundings\" aria-label=\"fundings permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Fundings</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>(April 2021 - March 2024) Kyoto University AI/Data science Fellowship. [<a href=\"http://www.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/fellowship/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">link</a>]</li>\n<li>(March 2021) Exemption from repayment of scholarships of JASSO due to outstanding achievements. (half) [<a href=\"https://www.jasso.go.jp/shogakukin/saiyochu/gyosekimenjo/hyoka.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">link</a>]</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Biography","date":null,"description":null,"socialImage":{"publicURL":"/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/fumilemon.png"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/biography/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["251939775","3563837177","401334301"]}